# oxfmt 0.64 does NOT format .md or .mdx. Its marketing page lists them, but
# the shipped binary leaves both untouched (verified: a deliberately misformatted
# .md and .mdx came back byte-identical while a .js in the same run was
# reformatted). The compatibility matrix agrees. Native Markdown/MDX is on the
# Q3 2026 roadmap, ported from Prettier.
#
# These entries are therefore belt-and-braces: they cost nothing now and stop
# content being reflowed the day support lands, since reformatting prose churns
# diffs and a collapsed code fence inside JSX breaks the build.
**/*.md
**/*.mdx
**/content/**

# Generated
**/tokens.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
dist/
.astro/
node_modules/
